{
  "id": "west-body-vo-01",
  "clips": [
    {
      "name": "N01",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "1865年7月20日晚，密苏里州，斯普林菲尔德。",
      "voice": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "N01.mp3",
      "bytes": 82798,
      "heard": "1865年7月20日晚密蘇里州斯普林菲爾德",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.995,
      "seconds": 5.12
    },
    {
      "name": "N02",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "一家旅馆里，两个老朋友在打牌。",
      "voice": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "N02.mp3",
      "bytes": 54795,
      "heard": "一家旅館裡兩個老朋友在打牌。",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 1.0,
      "seconds": 3.36
    },
    {
      "name": "N03",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "一个是北军侦察兵，比尔·希科克。",
      "voice": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "N03.mp3",
      "bytes": 52287,
      "heard": "一個是北軍偵察兵比爾希科克。",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.994,
      "seconds": 3.2
    },
    {
      "name": "N04",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "一个是南军老兵，戴维斯·塔特。",
      "voice": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "N04.mp3",
      "bytes": 48526,
      "heard": "一個是南軍老兵Diwis Tutter",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.989,
      "seconds": 2.96
    },
    {
      "name": "N05",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "仗刚打完，两人还坐在同一张桌上。",
      "voice": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "N05.mp3",
      "bytes": 56049,
      "heard": "仗刚打完 两人还坐在同一张桌上",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.999,
      "seconds": 3.44
    },
    {
      "name": "N06",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "为了一笔赌债，两人吵了起来。",
      "voice": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "N06.mp3",
      "bytes": 48526,
      "heard": "为了一笔赌债,两人吵了起来。",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.999,
      "seconds": 2.96
    },
    {
      "name": "T07",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "你欠我三十五块。",
      "voice": "lt7GBaCoAHWbT7JSZ5Xs",
      "voice_id": "lt7GBaCoAHWbT7JSZ5Xs",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "T07.mp3",
      "bytes": 26792,
      "heard": "你欠我三十五块",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.998,
      "seconds": 1.6
    },
    {
      "name": "H08",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "是二十五。",
      "voice": "WkcRFJo38X9XEP8kGExm",
      "voice_id": "WkcRFJo38X9XEP8kGExm",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "H08.mp3",
      "bytes": 24284,
      "heard": "是25",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.987,
      "seconds": 1.44
    },
    {
      "name": "N09",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "差了十块钱。",
      "voice": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "N09.mp3",
      "bytes": 24284,
      "heard": "差了十块钱",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.996,
      "seconds": 1.44
    },
    {
      "name": "N10",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "塔特一把抓起希科克的金怀表。",
      "voice": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "N10.mp3",
      "bytes": 41838,
      "heard": "塔特一把抓起希克克的精淮表",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.996,
      "seconds": 2.56
    },
    {
      "name": "T11",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "钱还清之前，表归我。",
      "voice": "lt7GBaCoAHWbT7JSZ5Xs",
      "voice_id": "lt7GBaCoAHWbT7JSZ5Xs",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "T11.mp3",
      "bytes": 35569,
      "heard": "前环境之前表归我",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.993,
      "seconds": 2.16
    },
    {
      "name": "N12",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "他还放话：明天要戴着这块表，走过广场。",
      "voice": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "N12.mp3",
      "bytes": 67752,
      "heard": "他還放話 明天要帶著這塊錶走過廣場",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.999,
      "seconds": 4.16
    },
    {
      "name": "N13",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "当众戴别人的表，就是当众羞辱他。",
      "voice": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "N13.mp3",
      "bytes": 54795,
      "heard": "当众带别人的表就是当众羞辱他",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.999,
      "seconds": 3.36
    },
    {
      "name": "H14",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "你敢戴着它走过广场，我就杀了你。",
      "voice": "WkcRFJo38X9XEP8kGExm",
      "voice_id": "WkcRFJo38X9XEP8kGExm",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "H14.mp3",
      "bytes": 52287,
      "heard": "你敢帶著他走過廣場我就殺了你",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.998,
      "seconds": 3.2
    },
    {
      "name": "N15",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "第二天傍晚六点，广场上的人突然散开了。",
      "voice": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "N15.mp3",
      "bytes": 69006,
      "heard": "第二天傍晚六點 廣場上的人突然散開了",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.996,
      "seconds": 4.24
    },
    {
      "name": "N16",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "希科克在广场一头等着。塔特，走了进来。",
      "voice": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "N16.mp3",
      "bytes": 71514,
      "heard": "希克克在廣場一頭等著塔特走了進來",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.999,
      "seconds": 4.4
    },
    {
      "name": "N17",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "两人相隔大约六十九米，差不多大半个足球场。",
      "voice": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "N17.mp3",
      "bytes": 70260,
      "heard": "兩人相隔大約69米 差不多大半個足球場",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 1.0,
      "seconds": 4.32
    },
    {
      "name": "H18",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "戴夫，别过来！",
      "voice": "WkcRFJo38X9XEP8kGExm",
      "voice_id": "WkcRFJo38X9XEP8kGExm",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "H18.mp3",
      "bytes": 23030,
      "heard": "大夫 别过来",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.999,
      "seconds": 1.36
    },
    {
      "name": "N19",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "据说，塔特先拔枪开了火。没打中。",
      "voice": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "N19.mp3",
      "bytes": 58557,
      "heard": "据说塔特先拔枪开了火没打中",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 1.0,
      "seconds": 3.6
    },
    {
      "name": "N20",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "希科克把枪架在手臂上，扣下了扳机。",
      "voice": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "N20.mp3",
      "bytes": 61065,
      "heard": "希科克把槍架在手臂上扣下了班機。",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 1.0,
      "seconds": 3.76
    },
    {
      "name": "T21",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "兄弟们，我中枪了。",
      "voice": "lt7GBaCoAHWbT7JSZ5Xs",
      "voice_id": "lt7GBaCoAHWbT7JSZ5Xs",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "T21.mp3",
      "bytes": 33061,
      "heard": "兄弟們 我中槍了",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.995,
      "seconds": 2.0
    },
    {
      "name": "N22",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "他倒在了法院门口。",
      "voice": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "N22.mp3",
      "bytes": 30554,
      "heard": "他倒在了法院门口",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.999,
      "seconds": 1.84
    },
    {
      "name": "N23",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "希科克被控过失杀人。",
      "voice": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "N23.mp3",
      "bytes": 40585,
      "heard": "希克克被控過失殺人",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.994,
      "seconds": 2.48
    },
    {
      "name": "N24",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "塔特的枪里，少了一发子弹。",
      "voice": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "N24.mp3",
      "bytes": 43510,
      "heard": "塔特的槍裡少了一發子彈",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.999,
      "seconds": 2.64
    },
    {
      "name": "N25",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "陪审团没讨论多久，就判他无罪。",
      "voice": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "N25.mp3",
      "bytes": 49780,
      "heard": "陪審團沒討論多久就判他無罪",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.999,
      "seconds": 3.04
    },
    {
      "name": "N26",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "可一桩街头枪杀，怎么就成了传奇？",
      "voice": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "N26.mp3",
      "bytes": 58557,
      "heard": "可一桩街头枪杀怎么就成了传奇",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.998,
      "seconds": 3.6
    },
    {
      "name": "N27",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "1867年，哈珀斯杂志把他写成了无所畏惧的英雄。",
      "voice": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "N27.mp3",
      "bytes": 85724,
      "heard": "1867年,哈泊斯雜誌把它寫成了無所畏懼的英雄。",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.999,
      "seconds": 5.28
    },
    {
      "name": "N28",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "同一年，有报道说，他杀过一百个人。",
      "voice": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "N28.mp3",
      "bytes": 58557,
      "heard": "同一年,有報導說他殺過一百個人",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.998,
      "seconds": 3.6
    },
    {
      "name": "N29",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "廉价小说一本接一本。后来，好莱坞把它拍成了你开头看到的样子：",
      "voice": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "N29.mp3",
      "bytes": 104950,
      "heard": "連架小說一本接一本後來,好萊塢把他拍成了你開頭看到的樣子",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.998,
      "seconds": 6.48
    },
    {
      "name": "N30",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "近在咫尺，四目相对，谁快谁活。",
      "voice": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "N30.mp3",
      "bytes": 63990,
      "heard": "盡在止尺四目相對誰快誰活",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.997,
      "seconds": 3.92
    },
    {
      "name": "N31",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "而斯普林菲尔德这一枪，被称为西部的第一场对决。",
      "voice": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "N31.mp3",
      "bytes": 71514,
      "heard": "而斯普林菲爾德這一槍被稱為西部的第一場對決",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.998,
      "seconds": 4.4
    },
    {
      "name": "N32",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "可故事还没完。2026年2月，当地翻出了一批旧档案。",
      "voice": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "N32.mp3",
      "bytes": 91994,
      "heard": "可故事还没完二年二六年二月当地翻出了一批旧档案",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.999,
      "seconds": 5.68
    },
    {
      "name": "N33",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "希科克站的位置，可能比传说中近得多。",
      "voice": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "N33.mp3",
      "bytes": 57303,
      "heard": "希科克站的位置可能比傳說中近得多",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.996,
      "seconds": 3.52
    },
    {
      "name": "N34",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "连那六十九米，也可能是传说。",
      "voice": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "N34.mp3",
      "bytes": 49780,
      "heard": "连那69米也可能是传说",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.999,
      "seconds": 3.04
    },
    {
      "name": "N35",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "十一年后，1876年，达科他的一家酒馆。希科克又坐上了牌桌。",
      "voice": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "N35.mp3",
      "bytes": 116235,
      "heard": "11年后,1876年,达科他的一家酒馆, 希克克又坐上了牌桌。",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.999,
      "seconds": 7.2
    },
    {
      "name": "N36",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "这一次，有人从背后开了枪。",
      "voice": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "N36.mp3",
      "bytes": 47272,
      "heard": "這一次有人從背後開了槍",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 1.0,
      "seconds": 2.88
    },
    {
      "name": "N37",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "他手里的牌：两张黑A，两张黑8。后来被叫作，死人之手。",
      "voice": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "N37.mp3",
      "bytes": 116235,
      "heard": "他手裡的牌,兩張黑A、兩張黑8,後來被叫做死人之手。",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.998,
      "seconds": 7.2
    },
    {
      "name": "N38",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "一场牌局开始了他的传奇，另一场牌局结束了它。",
      "voice": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "N38.mp3",
      "bytes": 89486,
      "heard": "一场牌局开始了他的传奇,另一场牌局结束了他。",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 1.0,
      "seconds": 5.52
    },
    {
      "name": "N39",
